<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron Electronics cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray cut its rating on Micron Electronics Inc to hold from strong buy after the company warned that computer sales would decline in the current third quarter from second-quarter levels.</p>
<p>-- In a report, analyst Bob Toomey said the decline indicated a &quot;serious problem,&quot; apparently stemming from an unexpected decline in consumer demand.</p>
</text>
